==Battleground==
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rider (Enemy)|Rider]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**20 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**8 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a tricky stage, since Ryder has really long range and a guaranteed freeze which will leave room for everything else to get good damage on your units. But Immune to Freeze Units will definitely help since they can provide support when the rest of your army is unable to do so, like [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Curling Cat]]. Bonus points if they do something against Red, like True Form [[Maiden Cat (Rare Cat)|Maiden Cat]]. Other general Tankers can help,  like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]. Again, Bonus points if they are against Red, like [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]].

To deal with the Red Peons, you can use [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]], [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]], or anything other Strong/Massive Damage against Red Units.

